Two-part change captured here:

1. Code: src/bootstrap.ts now installs SIGTERM/SIGINT handlers when run
   as the CLI entrypoint. server.close() drains, with a 10s
   force-exit safety net. Brings dist/bootstrap.js to parity with the
   prior hand-written bootstrap.mjs so docker stop is clean instead
   of relying on SIGKILL after the orchestrator grace deadline.

2. Ops: rebuilt iai-mail-api-pathb against this commit and swapped it
   in place on mail.iai.one. Legacy iai-mail-api container untouched.
   Volume /var/lib/iai-mail-api kept (evidence NDJSON continuity
   verified, 8 lines preserved across swap). Public smoke 6/6 green
   (T1 401 / T2 202+evidence_id / T3 list / T4 lookup / T5 408 stale
   ts / T6 legacy /_mail/health 200). Rollback path documented:
   prior image iai-mail-api-pathb:6f8c02c retained on the host.

Mail-api integration suite still 21/21 pass, typecheck + build clean.
